fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#GstAppSinkNewSampleCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSinkNewSampleCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewSampleCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewSampleCallback\n\nCalled when a new sample is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new sample can be retrieved with\ngst_app_sink_pull_sample either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\ncallback user data\nGST_FLOW_OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new sample is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new sample can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.prototype.pull_sample either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\nGst.FlowReturn.OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new sample is available. This callback is called from the\nstreaming thread. The new sample can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.pull_sample either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\nGst.FlowReturn.OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});